Template: @@NAME@@/add-microsoft-repo
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Add Microsoft apt repository for DoCode?
 The installer would like to add the Microsoft repository and signing
 key to update DoCode through apt.

Template: @@NAME@@/add-copilot-command
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Add the copilot command for GitHub Copilot CLI to PATH?
 The installer would like to add /usr/bin/copilot, which runs GitHub
 Copilot CLI and offers to install it when it's missing. The
 CopilotCliCommand policy in /etc/docode/policy.json takes precedence.
